ling).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831615228/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2832088942","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102346#issuecomment-2832088942","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102346","id":2832088942,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ozj9u","user":{"login":"gitsomebit","id":182990993,"node_id":"U_kgDOCug4kQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/182990993?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitsomebit","html_url":"https://github.com/gitsomebit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitsomebit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitsomebit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitsomebit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitsomebit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitsomebit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitsomebit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitsomebit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitsomebit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitsomebit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-26T12:18:00Z","updated_at":"2025-04-26T12:22:17Z","body":"Is there an easy way to animate the opening/closing of the FoldableContainer? Doing it with a Animation player seems hacky and tweens overly verbose for such an essential feature. Could an option be added for this - preferably with easing types?\r\n\r\nSmall nitpicks: \r\n- Why is the text property not called title considering the other propertys are called title_alignment and title_position? \r\n- The tooltip for foldable_group exlains itself with itself.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2832088942/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2832112655","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102346#issuecomment-2832112655","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102346","id":2832112655,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ozpwP","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-26T12:29:33Z","updated_at":"2025-04-26T12:29:33Z","body":"> Could an option be added for this - preferably with easing types?\r\n\r\nNo other Control has this feature and we don't have established way to implement it, so not sure.\r\nTweens might be verbose, but you can make a custom type extending FoldableContainer.\r\n\r\n> Why is the text property not called title considering the other propertys are called title_alignment and title_position?\r\n\r\nThere is also `text_direction` and `text_overrun_behavior`, but yeah, probably makes sense.\r\n\r\n> The tooltip for foldable_group exlains itself with itself.\r\n\r\nYou mean `foldable_group` property? It links to the FoldableGroup class, where you can find more info. `button_group` has the same description.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2832112655/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2833601858","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102346#issuecomment-2833601858","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102346","id":2833601858,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6o5VVC","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-27T19:18:09Z","updated_at":"2025-04-27T19:18:09Z","body":"> There is also text_direction and text_overrun_behavior, but yeah, probably 